  "Autodesk offers free licences for students and educators and a free option for personal, non-commercial use, though the terms change from time to time, so check Autodesk's website for the current details.": "Autodesk inatoa leseni za bure kwa wanafunzi na waelimishaji na chaguo la bure kwa matumizi ya kibinafsi, yasiyo ya kibiashara, ingawa masharti hubadilika mara kwa mara, kwa hivyo angalia tovuti ya Autodesk kwa maelezo ya sasa.",
  "Avoid Overly Deep and Narrow Pockets. Deep cavities require long, slender cutting tools that are prone to deflection, chatter, and tool breakage:": "Epuka Mifuko Mirefu na Midogo Sana. Matundu yenye kina kirefu yanahitaji vifaa virefu na vyembamba vya kukata ambavyo vinaweza kupotoka, kusikika, na kuvunjika kwa vifaa:",
  "B. Gurson-Tvergaard-Needleman (GTN) Damage Mechanics": "B. Gurson-Tvergaard-Needleman (GTN) Mitambo ya Uharibifu",
