  "Basics of CAD, CAM, and CAE": "Misingi ya CAD, CAM, na CAE",
  "Be upfront about when you need it and roughly what you can spend. A designer can then suggest the best approach within your limits. A simpler model now and refinements later, for example.": "Kuwa mwangalifu kuhusu wakati unaouhitaji na takriban kile unachoweza kutumia. Kisha mbunifu anaweza kupendekeza mbinu bora zaidi ndani ya mipaka yako. Mfano rahisi sasa na marekebisho baadaye, kwa mfano.",
  "Because Abaqus's built-in porous metal plasticity relies exclusively on an isotropic von Mises matrix, implementing an anisotropic GTN-Hill'48 model requires writing a custom Fortran subroutine (VUMAT for Explicit dynamics or UMAT for Implicit statics):": "Kwa sababu unyumbufu wa chuma wenye vinyweleo uliojengewa ndani wa Abaqus hutegemea pekee matrix ya isotropiki ya von Mises, kutekeleza modeli ya anisotropiki ya GTN-Hill'48 kunahitaji kuandika utaratibu maalum wa Fortran (VUMAT kwa mienendo dhahiri au UMAT kwa takwimu zisizo dhahiri):",
  "Before drawing anything, I listed the jobs the machine has to do: store water, filter it, brew the coffee and catch the drips. Each job became a zone of the machine, and the overall shape came from arranging those zones as compactly as possible.": "Kabla ya kuchora chochote, niliorodhesha kazi ambazo mashine inapaswa kufanya: kuhifadhi maji, kuchuja, kutengeneza kahawa na kukamata matone. Kila kazi ikawa eneo la mashine, na umbo la jumla lilitokana na kupanga maeneo hayo kwa ufupi iwezekanavyo.",
