  "By applying core Design for Manufacturability (DFM) principles during the modeling stage, you can optimize parts for faster production, reduced tool wear, and significantly lower costs.": "Kwa kutumia kanuni za Ubunifu wa Msingi kwa Uzalishaji (DFM) wakati wa hatua ya uundaji wa modeli, unaweza kuboresha vipuri kwa ajili ya uzalishaji wa haraka, kupunguza uchakavu wa vifaa, na gharama za chini sana.",
