  "Compute trial stress increments using Hooke's law assuming purely elastic deformation.": "Hesabu nyongeza za msongo wa majaribio kwa kutumia sheria ya Hooke ikizingatia mabadiliko ya elastic pekee.",
  "Contributed to the design and fabrication of a poultry de-feathering machine, from concept to mechanical assembly.": "Imechangia katika usanifu na utengenezaji wa mashine ya kuondoa manyoya ya kuku, kuanzia dhana hadi uundaji wa mitambo.",
  "Conventional von Mises plasticity assumes isotropic yielding, meaning a sheet deforms identically regardless of rolling or build direction. In reality, rolled sheets and additively manufactured metallic layers exhibit strong crystallographic texture and directional mechanical properties characterized by Lankford coefficients (r-values):": "Ubora wa kawaida wa von Mises hudhania kuwa na utofauti wa isotropiki, ikimaanisha kuwa karatasi huharibika sawasawa bila kujali mwelekeo wa kuviringika au ujenzi. Kwa kweli, karatasi zilizoviringishwa na tabaka za metali zilizotengenezwa kwa njia ya nyongeza huonyesha umbile imara la fuwele na sifa za kiufundi za mwelekeo zinazojulikana na viambato vya Lankford (thamani za r):",
  "Cooling:": "Kupoeza:",
  "Coupling Hill'48 with GTN captures both directional thinning and stress-triaxiality-driven fracture—outperforming standard isotropic FLDs on advanced alloys like AlSi10Mg and high-strength steels.": "Coupling Hill'48 na GTN inakamata kupunguka kwa kukonda kwa mwelekeo na kuvunjika kwa msongo wa mawazo—kuzidi FLD za isotropiki za kawaida zinazofanya kazi kwenye aloi za hali ya juu kama vile AlSi10Mg na vyuma vyenye nguvu nyingi.",
  "Coursework: Engineering Design I–III, CAD/CAM, Manufacturing Processes, Strength of Materials, Thermodynamics, Fluid Mechanics, Control Systems, Materials Science.": "Kazi ya Kozi: Ubunifu wa Uhandisi I–III, CAD/CAM, Michakato ya Uzalishaji, Nguvu ya Vifaa, Thermodynamics, Mekaniki za Maji, Mifumo ya Udhibiti, Sayansi ya Vifaa.",
  "Created 3D models, assemblies and 2D technical drawings in SolidWorks, Inventor and Fusion 360 for industrial prototypes.": "Aliunda modeli za 3D, mikusanyiko na michoro ya kiufundi ya 2D katika SolidWorks, Mvumbuzi na Fusion 360 kwa ajili ya mifano ya viwandani.",
