  "Custom hole dimensions require specialty drill bits, increasing setup time and tooling expenses:": "Vipimo maalum vya shimo vinahitaji vipande maalum vya kuchimba visima, na hivyo kuongeza muda wa usanidi na gharama za vifaa:",
  "Custom layouts for vision boards, travel plans and a dream-career page": "Miundo maalum ya mbao za maono, mipango ya usafiri na ukurasa wa ndoto-kazi",
  "Cutting through the model is the quickest way to check that the internal parts line up.": "Kukata modeli ndiyo njia ya haraka zaidi ya kuangalia kama sehemu za ndani ziko sawa.",
  "DEMO-2026": "ONYESHO-2026",
  "DFM explained simply: how designing with the workshop in mind cuts cost, avoids rework and gets parts made right the first time.": "DFM ilielezea kwa urahisi: jinsi kubuni kwa kuzingatia warsha hupunguza gharama, kuepuka kufanya kazi upya na kutengeneza vipuri vizuri mara ya kwanza.",
  "DFM in your CAD workflow": "DFM katika mtiririko wako wa kazi wa CAD",
  "Dark bamboo": "Mianzi nyeusi",
  "Delivered client projects including the design and thermal simulation of an EV battery cooling pack.": "Miradi ya wateja iliyowasilishwa ikiwa ni pamoja na muundo na uigaji wa joto wa kifurushi cha kupoeza betri ya EV.",
  "Describe the part or product in one or two sentences, and explain its job. \"A bracket that holds a 5 kg motor to a steel frame\" tells a designer far more than \"a bracket\".": "Eleza sehemu au bidhaa kwa sentensi moja au mbili, na ueleze kazi yake. \"Braketi inayoshikilia injini ya kilo 5 kwenye fremu ya chuma\" inamwambia mbuni zaidi ya \"braketi\".",
  "Design Parts with a Single Setup in Mind": "Ubunifu wa Vipuri kwa Kuzingatia Usanidi Mmoja",
  "Design and thermal simulation of an electric-vehicle battery cooling pack in SolidWorks and Inventor: 3D models, assemblies and thermal analysis to keep cells within their operating temperature range.": "Ubunifu na uigaji wa joto wa kifurushi cha kupoeza betri ya gari la umeme katika SolidWorks na Mvumbuzi: Mifumo ya 3D, mikusanyiko na uchambuzi wa joto ili kuweka seli ndani ya kiwango chao cha halijoto ya uendeshaji.",
  "Design around stock sheet thicknesses, bar sizes and off-the-shelf fasteners, bearings and seals. Standard items are cheaper, easier to find and easier to replace later.": "Buni kulingana na unene wa karatasi za hisa, saizi za baa na vifungashio, fani na mihuri vilivyo nje ya rafu. Bidhaa za kawaida ni za bei nafuu, rahisi kupata na rahisi kubadilisha baadaye.",
  "Design change with Global Variables: the jaw width goes from 100 to 120 mm and everything rebuilds": "Mabadiliko ya muundo na Vigezo vya Ulimwenguni: upana wa taya huanzia 100 hadi 120 mm na kila kitu hujengwa upya",
  "Design for Manufacturability": "Ubunifu wa Uzalishaji",
  "Design write-up": "Uandishi wa muundo",
  "Design, render and make, all in one": "Buni, onyesha na tengeneza, yote kwa pamoja",
  "Designing a coffee machine from concept to render": "Kubuni mashine ya kahawa kuanzia dhana hadi uwasilishaji",
  "Designing around functions first, and only then the shape, made every later decision easier. When I wasn't sure where a part should go, I went back to the job it had to do.": "Kubuni kazi zinazozunguka kwanza, na kisha tu umbo, kulifanya kila uamuzi wa baadaye kuwa rahisi. Nilipokuwa sijui sehemu inapaswa kwenda wapi, nilirudi kwenye kazi ambayo ilipaswa kufanya.",
  "Designing for Manufacturability:": "Ubunifu wa Uzalishaji:",
  "Designing for Manufacturability: 5 CAD Tips to Reduce Machining Costs": "Ubunifu kwa Ajili ya Uzalishaji: Vidokezo 5 vya CAD vya Kupunguza Gharama za Uchakataji",
  "Designing for Manufacturability: 5 CAD Tips to Reduce Machining Costs When transitioning a mechanical concept from a 3D CAD model to a physical prototype,…": "Ubunifu wa Uzalishaji: Vidokezo 5 vya CAD vya Kupunguza Gharama za Uchakataji Wakati wa kubadilisha dhana ya kiufundi kutoka kwa modeli ya 3D CAD hadi mfano halisi,…",
  "Designing for manufacturability doesn't mean sacrificing performance or aesthetic appeal. Integrating these practical guidelines early in your CAD workflow ensures your prototypes are not only functionally sound, but also cost-effective and ready for seamless production.": "Kubuni kwa ajili ya utengenezaji haimaanishi kupunguza utendaji au mvuto wa urembo. Kuunganisha miongozo hii ya vitendo mapema katika mtiririko wako wa kazi wa CAD huhakikisha mifano yako si tu kwamba ni mizuri kiutendaji, bali pia ni ya gharama nafuu na iko tayari kwa uzalishaji usio na mshono.",
  "Designing one complete thing, such as the": "Kubuni kitu kimoja kamili, kama vile",
  "Designs sized for your platforms": "Miundo yenye ukubwa wa majukwaa yako",
  "Determine GTN micro-parameters (": "Tambua vigezo vidogo vya GTN (",
  "Different uses need different formats:": "Matumizi tofauti yanahitaji miundo tofauti:",
  "Digital Image Correlation (DIC) tracks surface speckle patterns in real time, extracting major and minor principal strains immediately prior to localized necking via position-dependent or time-dependent cross-section methods.": "Uwiano wa Picha Dijitali (DIC) hufuatilia ruwaza za madoadoa ya uso kwa wakati halisi, ikitoa aina kuu na ndogo za msingi mara moja kabla ya kuunganishwa kwa ndani kupitia mbinu za sehemu mtambuka zinazotegemea nafasi au wakati.",
  "Digital version for sharing": "Toleo la kidijitali la kushiriki",
