  "Discover how combining Nakajima experimental testing with coupled GTN-Hill'48 user material subroutines in Abaqus accurately predicts anisotropic thinning, void-driven ductile fracture, and Forming Limit Curves for advanced sheet alloys like AlSi10Mg.": "Gundua jinsi kuchanganya majaribio ya Nakajima na taratibu ndogo za vifaa vya mtumiaji vya GTN-Hill'48 zilizounganishwa katika Abaqus kunavyotabiri kwa usahihi kukonda kwa anisotropic, kuvunjika kwa ductile inayoendeshwa kwa utupu, na Mikunjo ya Kikomo cha Kuunda kwa aloi za karatasi za hali ya juu kama AlSi10Mg.",
  "Do you include revisions?": "Je, unajumuisha marekebisho?",
