  "Inventor is Autodesk's professional mechanical design tool, also a Windows desktop application. Because it comes from the makers of AutoCAD, it works very smoothly with DWG drawings, which is a big plus in workplaces with years of AutoCAD files.": "Mvumbuzi ni kifaa cha kitaalamu cha usanifu wa mitambo cha Autodesk, pia ni programu ya kompyuta ya Windows. Kwa sababu inatoka kwa watengenezaji wa AutoCAD, inafanya kazi vizuri sana na michoro ya DWG, ambayo ni faida kubwa katika maeneo ya kazi yenye faili za AutoCAD za miaka mingi.",
  "It depends on the scope. A single poster is much quicker than a full assembly with simulation. We agree on a timeline together when I send your quote, and I'll keep you updated along the way.": "Inategemea wigo. Bango moja ni la haraka zaidi kuliko mkusanyiko kamili wenye simulizi. Tunakubaliana kuhusu ratiba pamoja nitakapotuma nukuu yako, nami nitakujulisha kila wakati.",
  "It has powerful tools for sheet metal, frame structures and large assemblies, and is commonly bought as part of Autodesk's Product Design & Manufacturing Collection alongside AutoCAD.": "Ina zana zenye nguvu za chuma cha karatasi, miundo ya fremu na mikusanyiko mikubwa, na kwa kawaida hununuliwa kama sehemu ya Mkusanyiko wa Ubunifu na Utengenezaji wa Bidhaa wa Autodesk pamoja na AutoCAD.",
  "It shows the product the way people will actually see it on a counter.": "Inaonyesha bidhaa jinsi watu watakavyoiona kwenye kaunta.",
