  "Lost somewhere in a huge drawing? Double-click the middle mouse button to zoom to everything. Scroll to zoom and hold the wheel to pan, so you'll rarely need the zoom commands at all.": "Umepotea mahali fulani kwenye mchoro mkubwa? Bonyeza mara mbili kitufe cha katikati cha kipanya ili kukuza kila kitu. Sogeza ili kukuza na ushikilie gurudumu kwenye sehemu ya juu, kwa hivyo hutahitaji amri za kukuza hata kidogo.",
