  "Macro Management and Visual Scripting (Introduction)": "Usimamizi wa Macro na Uandishi wa Hati za Kuonekana (Utangulizi)",
  "Maintain a minimum wall thickness of at least 0.8 mm for metals (aluminum/steel) and 1.5 mm for plastics.": "Dumisha unene wa ukuta wa angalau milimita 0.8 kwa metali (alumini/chuma) na milimita 1.5 kwa plastiki.",
  "Make the corner radius slightly larger than the standard milling tool radius (e.g., use a 3.2 mm radius for a 6 mm end mill). This allows the tool to turn smoothly without grinding into the corner.": "Fanya kipenyo cha kona kuwa kikubwa kidogo kuliko kipenyo cha kawaida cha kifaa cha kusaga (k.m., tumia kipenyo cha milimita 3.2 kwa kinu cha mwisho cha milimita 6). Hii inaruhusu kifaa kugeuka vizuri bila kusaga kwenye kona.",
