  "May – June 2026": "Mei - Juni 2026",
  "Mechanical Engineering": "Uhandisi wa Mitambo",
  "Mechanical Engineering Students Association (MESA), University of Nairobi (2022 – 2026)": "Chama cha Wanafunzi wa Uhandisi wa Mitambo (MESA), Chuo Kikuu cha Nairobi (2022 - 2026)",
  "Mechanical Engineering graduate from the University of Nairobi with hands-on CAD experience in SolidWorks, Autodesk Inventor and Fusion 360. I produce 3D models, assemblies and 2D technical drawings for industrial prototypes, and run Nexus CAD Studio, a CAD and graphic design studio that has trained over 100 people. My final-year project used coupled FE simulation of sheet metal forming, reflecting strong manufacturing and design fundamentals. I am eager to contribute to product development, prototyping and technical support.": "Nimehitimu katika Uhandisi wa Mitambo kutoka Chuo Kikuu cha Nairobi na uzoefu wa CAD katika SolidWorks, Autodesk Inventor na Fusion 360. Ninazalisha modeli za 3D, mikusanyiko na michoro ya kiufundi ya 2D kwa ajili ya mifano ya viwandani, na ninaendesha Nexus CAD Studio, studio ya CAD na usanifu wa michoro ambayo imewafunza zaidi ya watu 100. Mradi wangu wa mwaka wa mwisho ulitumia uigaji wa FE wa uundaji wa karatasi ya chuma, unaoakisi misingi imara ya utengenezaji na usanifu. Nina hamu ya kuchangia katika ukuzaji wa bidhaa, uundaji wa mifano na usaidizi wa kiufundi.",
  "Mechanical design for machines and products": "Ubunifu wa mitambo kwa mashine na bidhaa",
  "Memberships": "Uanachama",
  "Mesh Design": "Ubunifu wa Matundu",
  "Mesh Sensitivity Control:": "Udhibiti wa Unyeti wa Mesh:",
  "Mini brand guide": "Mwongozo mdogo wa chapa",
  "Model Based Annotations": "Maelezo Yanayotegemea Mfano",
  "Model Based Definition (MBD) and 3D Printing": "Ufafanuzi Unaotegemea Mfano (MBD) na Uchapishaji wa 3D",
  "Model preparation & meshing": "Maandalizi na uunganishaji wa modeli",
  "Modern CAD tools help. Sheet-metal tools in SolidWorks, Inventor and Fusion 360 build bend allowances into flat patterns automatically, and simulation lets you check strength before cutting any metal. My final-year project takes this further, using simulation to predict when sheet metal will fail during forming, before a single part is made.": "Zana za kisasa za CAD husaidia. Zana za karatasi-chuma katika SolidWorks, Inventor na Fusion 360 hujenga posho za kupinda katika mifumo tambarare kiotomatiki, na simulizi hukuruhusu kuangalia nguvu kabla ya kukata chuma chochote. Mradi wangu wa mwaka wa mwisho unaendelea zaidi, kwa kutumia simulizi kutabiri wakati karatasi ya chuma itashindwa wakati wa uundaji, kabla ya sehemu moja kutengenezwa.",
  "Mold Design": "Ubunifu wa Ukungu",
  "Mold Tools": "Vyombo vya Ukungu",
  "Most of a product's manufacturing cost is decided at the design stage, by the choice of material, the number of parts, the tolerances and the processes they require. Changing a CAD model is cheap. Changing a production run is not.": "Gharama nyingi za utengenezaji wa bidhaa huamuliwa katika hatua ya usanifu, kwa uchaguzi wa nyenzo, idadi ya vipuri, uvumilivu na michakato inayohitaji. Kubadilisha modeli ya CAD ni rahisi. Kubadilisha utaratibu wa uzalishaji si rahisi.",
  "Most people who feel \"slow\" in AutoCAD aren't missing skills. They're losing seconds on every single command, hunting through ribbons and menus. Those seconds add up to hours every week. Here are ten habits I teach in my free weekly webinar that make the biggest difference.": "Watu wengi wanaohisi \"polepole\" katika AutoCAD hawakosi ujuzi. Wanapoteza sekunde kwa kila amri, wakitafuta riboni na menyu. Sekunde hizo huongeza hadi saa kila wiki. Hapa kuna tabia kumi ninazofundisha katika semina yangu ya wavuti ya bure ya kila wiki ambayo hufanya tofauti kubwa zaidi.",
  "Mould tools:": "Vifaa vya ukungu:",
  "Multi-layer PTFE/grease tribological stacks minimize punch-sheet friction so fracture initiates near the dome apex rather than at the clamp radius.": "Mirundiko ya tribolojia ya PTFE/grisi yenye tabaka nyingi hupunguza msuguano wa karatasi ya kuchomwa kwa hivyo fracture huanza karibu na kilele cha kuba badala ya kwenye radius ya clamp.",
  "Multi-part assemblies with manufacturing-ready drawings.": "Mikusanyiko ya sehemu nyingi yenye michoro iliyo tayari kwa utengenezaji.",
  "My Autodesk Designathon 2026 entry: a compact station for disaster zones that stores, filters and supplies water for handwashing, and keeps the wastewater separate.": "Kiingilio changu cha Autodesk Designathon 2026: kituo kidogo cha maeneo ya maafa kinachohifadhi, kuchuja na kutoa maji kwa ajili ya kunawa mikono, na huweka maji machafu kando.",
  "My guide on": "Mwongozo wangu kwenye",
