  "Necking Detection:": "Ugunduzi wa Shingo:",
  "Need a part designed with manufacturing in mind?": "Unahitaji sehemu iliyoundwa kwa kuzingatia utengenezaji?",
  "Need assistance setting up custom material subroutines, nonlinear FEA simulations, or precision CAD tooling models? Reach out to Nexus CAD Studio to discuss your engineering simulation workflow.": "Unahitaji usaidizi wa kuanzisha utaratibu mdogo wa nyenzo maalum, uigaji wa FEA usio wa mstari, au mifumo ya zana za usahihi wa CAD? Wasiliana na Nexus CAD Studio ili kujadili mtiririko wako wa kazi wa uigaji wa uhandisi.",
  "Need the flat blank length for a bent part? Try my free": "Unahitaji urefu tambarare usio na kitu kwa sehemu iliyopinda? Jaribu yangu ya bure",
  "Nexus CAD Studio": "Studio ya Nexus CAD",
  "Nexus CAD Studio, Nairobi": "Studio ya Nexus CAD, Nairobi",
  "Nine inverted 19-litre carboys sit on a header tank at the top. Together they hold about 170 litres, enough for many handwashes before anyone needs to refill. Because the carboys plug straight in, a full one can be swapped for an empty one in seconds.": "Kaboi tisa za lita 19 zilizogeuzwa zimekaa kwenye tanki la kichwa juu. Kwa pamoja zinashikilia takriban lita 170, za kutosha kwa ajili ya kunawa mikono mingi kabla ya mtu yeyote kuhitaji kujaza tena. Kwa sababu kaboi huunganishwa moja kwa moja, moja kamili inaweza kubadilishwa na ile tupu kwa sekunde chache.",
  "No interference anywhere in the assembly": "Hakuna kuingiliwa popote katika mkutano",
  "Non-Linear Dynamic Analysis": "Uchambuzi Unaobadilika Usio wa Mstari",
  "Non-Linear Static Analysis": "Uchambuzi Tuli Usio wa Mstari",
