  "Once": "Mara moja",
  "Once you accept your quote, you pay the deposit shown on it to confirm your project, by M-Pesa to Buy Goods Till": "Ukishakubali nukuu yako, unalipa amana iliyoonyeshwa juu yake ili kuthibitisha mradi wako, na M-Pesa ili kununua bidhaa.",
  "One consistent design across the whole series": "Muundo mmoja thabiti katika mfululizo mzima",
  "One side of the machine is a clear acrylic panel. It shows the twin filter cartridges and the internal layout, so you can see at a glance when the filters need attention. It also turns the engineering into part of the look.": "Upande mmoja wa mashine ni paneli ya akriliki iliyo wazi. Inaonyesha katriji mbili za vichujio na mpangilio wa ndani, kwa hivyo unaweza kuona kwa haraka wakati vichujio vinahitaji uangalifu. Pia hubadilisha uhandisi kuwa sehemu ya mwonekano.",
  "One-on-one courses follow the same order, but we can skip what you already know or spend longer where you need it.": "Kozi za ana kwa ana hufuata mpangilio uleule, lakini tunaweza kuruka kile unachokijua tayari au kutumia muda mrefu zaidi unapokihitaji.",
  "One-on-one or group training, online or in person in Nairobi.": "Mafunzo ya ana kwa ana au ya kikundi, mtandaoni au ana kwa ana jijini Nairobi.",
