  "Quotes": "Nukuu",
  "Reading the results honestly": "Kusoma matokeo kwa uaminifu",
  "Real course hours for SolidWorks, Inventor, Fusion 360, Creo and Revit, how much practice you need on top, and what you can do after 2 weeks, 2 months and 6 months.": "Saa halisi za kozi kwa SolidWorks, Mvumbuzi, Fusion 360, Creo na Revit, ni mazoezi mangapi unayohitaji juu, na unachoweza kufanya baada ya wiki 2, miezi 2 na miezi 6.",
  "Real products are assemblies. You'll insert components, mate them correctly (standard and advanced mates), work both bottom-up and top-down, make exploded views and a bill of materials, and run a basic motion study. We also use the Toolbox library and smart fasteners, so you never model a standard bolt by hand again.": "Bidhaa halisi ni mikusanyiko. Utaingiza vipengele, kuviunganisha kwa usahihi (vifaa vya kawaida na vya hali ya juu), kufanya kazi kutoka chini hadi juu hadi chini, kufanya mionekano iliyolipuka na bili ya vifaa, na kufanya utafiti wa msingi wa mwendo. Pia tunatumia maktaba ya Toolbox na vifungashio mahiri, kwa hivyo hutawahi kuunda boliti ya kawaida kwa mkono tena.",
  "Realistic assembly details, like fasteners and fillets, and real materials from the Fusion library": "Maelezo halisi ya kusanyiko, kama vile vifungashio na minofu, na vifaa halisi kutoka kwa maktaba ya Fusion",
