  "Sharp internal vertical corners cannot be produced by round, rotating CNC drill bits. Always add fillets to internal vertical edges. To keep tool changes minimal:": "Pembe kali za ndani za wima haziwezi kuzalishwa kwa kutumia vipande vya kuchimba vya CNC vinavyozunguka. Daima ongeza minofu kwenye kingo za ndani za wima. Ili kupunguza mabadiliko ya kifaa:",
