  "Simulation lets you test a design before you cut a single piece of steel. But \"can you simulate it?\" can mean two quite different things. Picking the right one saves time and money, so here's how to tell them apart.": "Uigaji hukuruhusu kujaribu muundo kabla ya kukata kipande kimoja cha chuma. Lakini \"unaweza kuiga?\" inaweza kumaanisha mambo mawili tofauti kabisa. Kuchagua sahihi huokoa muda na pesa, kwa hivyo hivi ndivyo unavyoweza kuyatofautisha.",
  "SimulationXpress for a first stress check, FloXpress for flow, DFMXpress for manufacturability, plus costing": "SimulationXpress kwa ajili ya ukaguzi wa kwanza wa msongo wa mawazo, FloXpress kwa ajili ya mtiririko, DFMXpress kwa ajili ya utengenezaji, pamoja na gharama",
