  "SolidWorks vs Inventor vs Fusion 360: which should you learn?": "SolidWorks dhidi ya Mvumbuzi dhidi ya Fusion 360: unapaswa kujifunza nini?",
  "SolidWorks, from Dassault Systèmes, is one of the most widely used mechanical CAD tools in industry. It's a Windows desktop application known for an approachable interface and strong part, assembly and drawing tools, with simulation available inside the same environment.": "SolidWorks, kutoka Dassault Systèmes, ni mojawapo ya zana za CAD za mitambo zinazotumika sana katika tasnia. Ni programu ya kompyuta ya mezani ya Windows inayojulikana kwa kiolesura kinachoweza kufikiwa kwa urahisi na zana imara za sehemu, mkusanyiko na kuchora, pamoja na simulizi inayopatikana katika mazingira yaleyale.",
  "SolidWorks? The software is huge. Most people need a clear path from a blank screen to a part a workshop can actually make, without getting lost in menus they'll never use.": "SolidWorks? Programu hii ni kubwa sana. Watu wengi wanahitaji njia iliyo wazi kutoka skrini tupu hadi sehemu ambayo warsha inaweza kutengeneza, bila kupotea kwenye menyu ambazo hawatatumia kamwe.",
  "Space": "Nafasi",
  "Stainless steel": "Chuma cha pua",
  "Standardize Hole Sizes and Thread Depth": "Sawazisha Ukubwa wa Shimo na Kina cha Uzi",
  "Standardized under ISO 12004-2, the Nakajima test is the industry benchmark for characterizing sheet metal formability across the entire strain space—from uniaxial tension on the left side of the FLD to equibiaxial stretching on the right.": "Ikiwa imesanifishwa chini ya ISO 12004-2, jaribio la Nakajima ni kipimo cha tasnia cha kubainisha uundaji wa chuma cha karatasi katika nafasi nzima ya mkazo—kuanzia mvutano wa uniaxial upande wa kushoto wa FLD hadi kunyoosha kwa usawa upande wa kulia.",
